{"id":"mahabharata-5-097","work":"mahabharata","part":5,"partName":"उद्योगपर्व","partNameEn":"Udyoga Parva","unit":97,"title":"सप्तनवतितमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 97 · The city of Patala","summary":{"en":"Narada shows Matali the city of Patala at the navel of the serpent world, where the demons bound by time dwell and the fire of the ocean burns. Matali finds nothing there to his liking.","kn":"ನಾಗಲೋಕದ ನಾಭಿಯಲ್ಲಿರುವ, ಕಾಲಬದ್ಧ ದೈತ್ಯರು ವಾಸಿಸುವ, ಸಮುದ್ರಾಗ್ನಿ ಉರಿಯುವ ಪಾತಾಳನಗರವನ್ನು ನಾರದರು ಮಾತಲಿಗೆ ತೋರಿಸುತ್ತಾರೆ. ಮಾತಲಿಗೆ ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಮೆಚ್ಚುವಂಥದ್ದೇನೂ ಸಿಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ.","hi":"नारद मातलि को नागलोक की नाभि में स्थित पाताल नगर दिखाते हैं, जहाँ काल से बँधे दैत्य रहते हैं और समुद्र की अग्नि जलती है। मातलि को वहाँ कुछ भी पसन्द नहीं आता।","te":"నాగలోకపు నాభిలో ఉన్న, కాలబద్ధులైన దైత్యులు నివసించే, సముద్రాగ్ని మండే పాతాళనగరాన్ని నారదుడు మాతలికి చూపిస్తాడు. మాతలికి అక్కడ నచ్చినదేదీ కనిపించదు.","ta":"நாகலோகத்தின் நடுவில் உள்ள, காலத்தால் கட்டுண்ட அசுரர்கள் வாழும், கடல் தீ எரியும் பாதாள நகரை நாரதர் மாதலிக்குக் காட்டுகிறார். மாதலிக்கு அங்கு விருப்பமானது எதுவும் இல்லை.","ml":"സർപ്പലോകത്തിന്റെ നാഭിയിലുള്ള പാതാളനഗരം നാരദൻ മാതലിക്ക് കാണിക്കുന്നു; കാലത്താൽ ബന്ധിക്കപ്പെട്ട അസുരന്മാർ അവിടെ വസിക്കുന്നുണ്ട്, സമുദ്രത്തിലെ അഗ്നി ജ്വലിക്കുന്നു. അവിടെയും മാതലിക്ക് ഇഷ്ടപ്പെട്ടതൊന്നും കണ്ടെത്താനായില്ല."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 5.97; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Jan 23 2024","sections":[{"title":"भगवद्यानपर्व","titleEn":"Bhagavadyana Parva (Krishna's embassy)","verses":[{"text":"नारद उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Narada said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"एतत्तु नागलोकस्य नाभिस्थाने स्थितं पुरम् ।\nपातालमिति विख्यातं दैत्यदानवसेवितम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"This city lies at the navel of the world of the Nagas. It is famed as Patala, and the Daityas and Danavas dwell in it."}},{"n":2,"text":"इदमद्भिः समं प्राप्ता ये केचिद्ध्रुवजङ्गमाः ।\nप्रविशन्तो महानादं नदन्ति भयपीडिताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Whatever creatures, moving or still, are swept in here with the waters cry out loudly in fear as they enter."}},{"n":3,"text":"अत्रासुरोऽग्निः सततं दीप्यते वारिभोजनः ।\nव्यापारेण धृतात्मानं निबद्धं समबुध्यत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here burns without pause the demonic fire that feeds on water; it was understood to be held bound by its labor."}},{"n":4,"text":"अत्रामृतं सुरैः पीत्वा निहितं निहतारिभिः ।\nअतः सोमस्य हानिश्च वृद्धिश्चैव प्रदृश्यते ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here the gods drank the nectar and laid the remainder, after they had slain their foes. That is why the moon is seen to wane and to wax."}},{"n":5,"text":"अत्र दिव्यं हयशिरः काले पर्वणि पर्वणि ।\nउत्तिष्ठति सुवर्णाभं वार्भिरापूरयञ्जगत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here, at each junction of the lunar fortnight, a golden divine horse-head rises and fills the world with water."}},{"n":6,"text":"यस्मादत्र समग्रास्ताः पतन्ति जलमूर्तयः ।\nतस्मात्पातालमित्येतत्ख्यायते पुरमुत्तमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Because all those watery forms fall down into this place, this excellent city is called Patala."}},{"n":7,"text":"ऐरावतोऽस्मात्सलिलं गृहीत्वा जगतो हितः ।\nमेघेष्वामुञ्चते शीतं यन्महेन्द्रः प्रवर्षति ॥","meaning":{"en":"From here Airavata draws up water for the good of the world and pours it cold into the clouds, from which great Indra sends rain."}},{"n":8,"text":"अत्र नानाविधाकारास्तिमयो नैकरूपिणः ।\nअप्सु सोमप्रभां पीत्वा वसन्ति जलचारिणः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here live great fish of many shapes and kinds, creatures of the water that drink the moon's radiance in the waves."}},{"n":9,"text":"अत्र सूर्यांशुभिर्भिन्नाः पातालतलमाश्रिताः ।\nमृता दिवसतः सूत पुनर्जीवन्ति ते निशि ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here, Suta, beings in the depths of Patala are struck down by the sun's rays and die by day, yet they live again at night."}},{"n":10,"text":"उदये नित्यशश्चात्र चन्द्रमा रश्मिभिर्वृतः ।\nअमृतं स्पृश्य संस्पर्शात्संजीवयति देहिनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Each time the moon rises here, wrapped in its beams, its touch of nectar revives embodied beings."}},{"n":11,"text":"अत्र तेऽधर्मनिरता बद्धाः कालेन पीडिताः ।\nदैतेया निवसन्ति स्म वासवेन हृतश्रियः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here lived those Daityas, devoted to unrighteousness, bound and tormented by Time, robbed of their glory by Indra."}},{"n":12,"text":"अत्र भूतपतिर्नाम सर्वभूतमहेश्वरः ।\nभूतये सर्वभूतानामचरत्तप उत्तमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here the lord of beings, great Lord of all creatures, performed supreme austerity for the welfare of all beings."}},{"n":13,"text":"अत्र गोव्रतिनो विप्राः स्वाध्यायाम्नायकर्शिताः ।\nत्यक्तप्राणा जितस्वर्गा निवसन्ति महर्षयः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Here dwell great seers, brahmins who keep the cow-vow, wasted by study and the sacred tradition, who have given up life and conquered heaven."}},{"n":14,"text":"यत्रतत्रशयो नित्यं येनकेनचिदाशितः ।\nयेनकेनचिदाच्छन्नः स गोव्रत इहोच्यते ॥","meaning":{"en":"One who always sleeps wherever he happens to be, eats whatever he happens to get, and wears whatever covers him is called here a cow-vow keeper."}},{"n":15,"text":"ऐरावतो नागराजो वामनः कुमुदोऽञ्जनः ।\nप्रसूताः सुप्रतीकस्य वंशे वारणसत्तमाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Airavata, king of serpents, with Vamana, Kumuda and Anjana, were born in the line of Supratika as the finest of elephants."}},{"n":16,"text":"पश्य यद्यत्र ते कश्चिद्रोचते गुणतो वरः ।\nवरयिष्याव तं गत्वा यत्नमास्थाय मातले ॥","meaning":{"en":"Look, Matali, whether any of them here pleases you as a worthy groom; if so, we shall go and choose him with effort."}},{"n":17,"text":"अण्डमेतज्जले न्यस्तं दीप्यमानमिव श्रिया ।\nआ प्रजानां निसर्गाद्वै नोद्भिद्यति न सर्पति ॥","meaning":{"en":"This egg, placed in the water and shining as if with splendor, neither breaks open nor moves from the creation of beings until now."}},{"n":18,"text":"नास्य जातिं निसर्गं वा कथ्यमानं शृणोमि वै ।\nपितरं मातरं वापि नास्य जानाति कश्चन ॥","meaning":{"en":"I have not heard its species or nature spoken of, and nobody knows its father or mother."}},{"n":19,"text":"अतः किल महानग्निरन्तकाले समुत्थितः ।\nधक्ष्यते मातले सर्वं त्रैलोक्यं सचराचरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"From it, they say, a great fire will arise at the end of time, Matali, and burn all three worlds with everything moving and unmoving."}},{"text":"कण्व उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Kanva said:"}},{"n":20,"text":"मातलिस्त्वब्रवीच्छ्रुत्वा नारदस्याथ भाषितम् ।\nन मेऽत्र रोचते कश्चिदन्यतो व्रज माचिरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing Narada's words, Matali replied, 'None here pleases me. Go elsewhere without delay.'"}}]}]}